 & code","Engines & scenes","Testing","Build & release","Topics",[86,87,88,89,90],"tags","Unreal Engine","Automated testing","Blueprint","Visual regression","Content validation","Further reading",[93],{"_51":94,"_25":95},"Command-line reports and interrupted-run resumption","https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/en-us/unreal-engine/run-automation-tests-in-unreal-engine","Project source",[98],{"_51":96,"_25":99},"https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/en-us/unreal-engine/automation-test-framework-in-unreal-engine","Why it belongs here","Can bring Blueprint compilation, level loading, simulated input, and visual regression checks into an agent feedback loop, alongside interfaces such as Functional Testing. Tests require the appropriate plugins and state cleanup; the framework runs within the engine. ResumeRunTest reads an existing JSON report, resumes NotRun tests, and marks interrupted in-progress tests as failures. Preserve the report and distinguish compatible editor and client test contexts.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Tool","Category","Engines & creation tools","category","lead","summary","name","engines","tool",[86,87,88,89,90],[121,122,123,124],[119,120],[118],{"_51":94,"_25":95},"2d","3d","code","scene","test","ship",{"_126":127},"documents",{"_128":129,"_130":131},"en",[133,137,138,139,136,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,135,172,134,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190],"zh",[132,133,134,135,136],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging